/**
 * Check-rollup for a head sha: 'green' (all concluded SUCCESS), 'red'
 * (any FAILURE/TIMED_OUT/CANCELLED), 'pending' (queued/in flight),
 * 'none' (no evidence at all — nothing concluded anywhere).
 *
